  "comment": "Obstacles of a real run's arenas (Obstacles.GenerateArena), one profile per décor: 'tilesets' lists the ROM tileset numbers (DungeonTileset.romId) it is for, 'fallback' serves the others. Same format as obstacle_room.json, plus: walls: how many of the generator's rectangular wall blocks are kept (-1: all); decorWater: water drawn with the décor's own secondary layer. Light by design: 1 or 2 features, the team's spawn point kept clear (spawnClear). Pylons and metal stay rare here (weight 1): they are meant for themed rooms. Switched off by obstaclesInRuns in meta.json.",
